  "name": "Relentless Reflexes: finishing moves in a tank stance grant stacking dodge without refreshing it (#6956)",
  "contract": [
    "Relentless Reflexes 276302 'Your finishing moves grant Relentless Reflexes, increasing dodge chance by",
    "$276306s1% per stack. Stacks up to $276306u times and lasts $276306d. The duration is not refreshed when gaining",
    "stacks.' 276306: +4% dodge per stack, 5 stacks, 16 s. 276302 is a passive with Stances 0x8a0400 (forms 11, 18",
    "Defensive Stance, 20, 24); Bear Form (5/8) is not among them, so the request to add bear forms contradicts the",
    "client data. 276302 has no proc flags, rule or script, so no stance grants anything today.",
    "Expected: in Defensive Stance each Eviscerate adds a stack and +4% dodge; the second stack keeps the first",
    "stack's remaining duration.",
    "276302 and 276306 carry EquippedItemClass 4 (armor) with subclass mask 64 (shield): Aura::GetProcEffectMask refuses the passive's proc without a usable shield in the off hand, so the Hero carries a buckler.",
    "PLAYER_DODGE_PERCENTAGE is clamped at 0: a Hero with low Defense skill sits below 0, so the first run saw +1.13 (from -2.87 to 1.13). Defense is set to its level-60 maximum before the base is read.",
    "A fresh Hero's raw dodge can sit below 0, and the dodge field is clamped at 0, so the +4% per stack is measured between the first and the second stack, both above the clamp."
  ],
